{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a long-abandoned land and discover the secrets hidden within. Along the way, you\u2019ll learn a variety of new abilities and use them to unravel one mystery after another.\u00a0In the end, what will you choose: endless solitude, or eternal slumber?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969530/extras/d44b192b6569bb8223588f4c83d30932.avif?t=1768300565\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring exquisite cartoon pixel art and visual effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No violence, no death \u2014 everything is focused on puzzles and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 meticulously designed levels, packed with creative puzzles and collectibles scattered across the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich environmental interactions for an immersive exploration experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and easter eggs hidden throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course\u2026 <i>chocolate is delicious, meow.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969530?t=1768300565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969530?t=1768300565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969530/27ae325f639ecf2097abadf3dfe3f99652406e3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768300565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969530/27ae325f639ecf2097abadf3dfe3f99652406e3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768300565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description